    skos:editorialNote "This concept is a controlled value naming the proprioceptive neural system as a stimulation target. ADR 0021 holds such a value to be an information category rather than the entity it classifies, while UBERON:0025533 proprioceptive system denotes the entity itself, so closeMatch is the strongest defensible relation and exactMatch is deliberately not asserted. No Wikidata mapping is asserted: Wikidata has proprioception, which is the sense rather than the system, and would be a different claim."@en .

