###########################################################################
# Delivery media — tranche 2 (2026-09-06)
#
# Reviewed candidate set from docs/ontology/ALIGNMENT_CANDIDATES.md §7.1, which
# holds the evidence per row. MeSH carries most of this tranche because its
# physical-agent descriptors classify exactly what a delivery medium is, and
# because their scope notes are precise enough to decide containment instead of
# leaving everything at closeMatch. Three rows are broadMatch and one is
# narrowMatch for that reason, and they are the rows a label-similarity pass
# would have got wrong:
#
#   MeSH Light spans visible, ultraviolet and infrared, so it is broader than
#   this vocabulary's visible-light medium;
#   MeSH Sound is the audible band, so acoustic energy here contains it.
#
# Two exact-label candidates were rejected rather than mapped, both recorded in
# the editorial notes below: mesh:D057086 and wd:Q564897 for focused ultrasound,
# which are ablative, and wd:Q4698686 for airflow, which is a measurement.
#
# Eleven media in the same scheme carry no mapping on purpose. Label search
# returned an album, a video game, a camping festival and a run of journal
# articles for several of them, and nothing defensible for the rest.
#
# Two rows below make `make alignment-verify` print REVIEW, and both are correct.
# The gate flags a strong mapping whose target label shares no word with ours,
# which is the check that would have caught MeSH D012910 and SNOMED 229070002.
# Here it fires on mediumAirflow against "Air Movements" and on
# mediumPharmacologicalAgent against "Pharmaceutical Preparations": different
# words, same subject, confirmed against each descriptor's scope note. Leave them
# flagged rather than special-cased, and read the note before dismissing a third.
###########################################################################

sstim-ex:mediumVisualLight skos:broadMatch mesh:D008027 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    owl:annotatedSource sstim-ex:mediumVisualLight ;
    owl:annotatedProperty skos:broadMatch ;
    owl:annotatedTarget mesh:D008027 ;
    dct:source <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008027> ;
    dct:date "2026-09-06"^^xsd:date ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9699-629X> ;
    skos:editorialNote "MeSH Light is \"that portion of the electromagnetic spectrum in the visible, ultraviolet, and infrared range\". This concept is visible light delivered by a display, lamp, projector or environment, so the descriptor is strictly broader. Recorded because the labels invite an equality that the scope note refuses."@en .

sstim-ex:mediumVisualLight skos:relatedMatch wd:Q76299 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    owl:annotatedSource sstim-ex:mediumVisualLight ;
    owl:annotatedProperty skos:relatedMatch ;
    owl:annotatedTarget wd:Q76299 ;
    dct:source <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q76299> ;
    dct:date "2026-09-06"^^xsd:date ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9699-629X> ;
    skos:editorialNote "The item is a spectral band; this concept is a delivery medium. Associated without either containing the other."@en .

sstim-ex:mediumAcousticEnergy skos:narrowMatch mesh:D013016 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    owl:annotatedSource sstim-ex:mediumAcousticEnergy ;
    owl:annotatedProperty skos:narrowMatch ;
    owl:annotatedTarget mesh:D013016 ;
    dct:source <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D013016> ;
    dct:date "2026-09-06"^^xsd:date ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9699-629X> ;
    skos:editorialNote "MeSH Sound classifies energy above the audible range as ultrasonic and below it as infrasonic, so the descriptor is the audible band. This concept is explicitly \"whether or not it is audible\" and therefore contains it."@en .

sstim-ex:mediumAirConductedSound skos:broadMatch mesh:D013016 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    owl:annotatedSource sstim-ex:mediumAirConductedSound ;
    owl:annotatedProperty skos:broadMatch ;
    owl:annotatedTarget mesh:D013016 ;
    dct:source <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D013016> ;
    dct:date "2026-09-06"^^xsd:date ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9699-629X> ;
    skos:editorialNote "The descriptor covers transmission through solid, liquid or gas; this concept is the air path before the ear or body, which is one of the three."@en .

sstim-ex:mediumMechanicalVibration skos:broadMatch mesh:D014732 .

[] a owl:Axiom ;
    owl:annotatedSource sstim-ex:mediumMechanicalVibration ;
    owl:annotatedProperty skos:broadMatch ;
    owl:annotatedTarget mesh:D014732 ;
    dct:source <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D014732> ;
